From 531999548cd1d3a6a8f053cd6508c3b26ea1ff21 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sunshineinabox <aqemail@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 22:15:42 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(CapabilityMap): add auto_center option for evdev
 joystick axes

A stick whose resting reading is not the middle of its range drifts
in one direction for as long as it is at rest.

With `auto_center: true` on a joystick_x/joystick_y evdev mapping, the
axis is normalized around its value when the device was opened instead.

---
